task_id: coding_0025
task_type: coding
instruction: "The file nums.txt contains 25 integers. Print the third largest distinct value among them. Write a program in any language (python3, bash, awk, etc.) that computes it. Run the program and write ONLY its output to the file answer.txt in the current directory (for example with bash: echo 42 > answer.txt). Work only inside the current directory."
reward: 4
expected: "89"
check: exact_int